+# Gaotus Mobility Passenger v0.6.8+29 — Explicit Extras Autocharge Consent
+
+- Online ride checkout now exposes an explicit opt-in for automatic charging of verified trip extras.
+- Consent defaults OFF and is forced OFF when Pay in Car is selected.
+- The app sends `extras_autocharge_consent` to the Platform only for online bookings.
+- The explanatory copy states that waiting/parking extras are charged only when a reusable saved payment method is available; otherwise a payment link is sent.
+- Romania localisation is included for both consent title and explanation.
+- No changes to Firebase, push notification, realtime, chat, GPS-first map logic, map provider, package id or notification channel ids.
