 - Loads Country Pack from the public `/health` endpoint before unauthenticated UI is shown.
 - Caches the last known country/language so Romania stays Romanian at login after restart or brief network loss.
 - Localizes common login and registration errors before authentication.
+
+## v0.6.8+29 — Payment consent
+Online ride booking includes an explicit, off-by-default consent control for verified extras autocharge. The Platform remains authoritative: consent alone does not permit a charge unless a reusable owned WooCommerce token and compatible gateway are available.
